1
00:00:00,647 --> 00:00:04,247
(Howard:)not trying to get to the bottom
of a dog-walking scam.

2
00:00:05,552 --> 00:00:07,082
Oh, stop!

3
00:00:07,087 --> 00:00:08,657
(Bernadette:)You know what's
really happening?

4
00:00:08,655 --> 00:00:10,185
(Bernadette:)All the movies
you've watched,

5
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:11,590
(Bernadette:)the TV shows, the comic books...

6
00:00:11,592 --> 00:00:13,292
(Bernadette:)they've completely twisted
your thinking.

7
00:00:13,293 --> 00:00:14,863
(Bernadette:)No one's after you,
no one's listening to you,

8
00:00:14,862 --> 00:00:16,892
(Bernadette:)no one cares about you.

9
00:00:18,699 --> 00:00:19,929
(Raj:)I'd like to think

10
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:22,433
the "Four on Your Side" guy
cares about me.

11
00:00:25,405 --> 00:00:27,475
(Penny:)You know, Beverly,
I know you and Alfred

12
00:00:27,474 --> 00:00:30,174
(Penny:)have your differences,
but if you think about it,

13
00:00:30,177 --> 00:00:32,777
(Penny:)if you hadn't married him,
there'd be no Leonard.

14
00:00:32,779 --> 00:00:33,979
(chuckles)

15
00:00:33,981 --> 00:00:35,481
(Penny:)So that's good, right?

16
00:00:35,482 --> 00:00:36,512
Eh.

17
00:00:42,222 --> 00:00:44,692
(Leonard:)Is that Howard
in front of us?

18
00:00:44,691 --> 00:00:46,261
(Penny:)Oh, maybe.

19
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:48,160
(Penny:)Get closer.

20
00:00:49,796 --> 00:00:51,466
(Howard:)Oh, God.

21
00:00:51,465 --> 00:00:54,265
(Howard:)I think someone's
following us.

22
00:00:54,268 --> 00:00:56,568
(Bernadette:)You're being ridiculous.

23
00:00:56,570 --> 00:00:59,340
(Howard:)I'm not being ridiculous...
he's right on my tail.

